{"kind": "mod", "id": 1756, "name": "WTT Armory - Realism Compatibility Patch", "slug": "wtt-armory-realism-compatibility-patch", "teaser": "This adds SPT Realism compatibility for some weapon mods that are part of WTT Amory.", "owner_name": "Therkelsen", "downloads": 6889, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-13T18:03:17.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-09-30T18:23:02.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-09-30T18:23:02.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.10.0", "latest_version": "1.1.1", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p><strong>Content</strong></p>\n<p>Compatibility patches for the following WTT (and some that aren’t WTT) mods:</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/25352-tron/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Tron</strong></a>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2056-wtt-armory-ak5c/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WTT - Armory - Ak5C</a></strong> v1.0.3</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2173-wtt-armory-auto-5/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>WTT - Armory - Auto-5</strong></a> v1.0.1</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2023-wtt-armory-%C4%8Dz-75/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>WTT - Armory - ČZ-75</strong></a> v1.0.6</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1818-wtt-little-drummer-boy/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>WTT - Little Drummer Boy</strong></a> v1.0.6</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1984-wtt-armory-hk417/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>WTT - Armory - HK417</strong></a> v1.1.7</li>\n<li><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2338-wtt-armory-iwi-carmel/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WTT - Armory - IWI Carmel</a></strong> v1.0.1</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2381-wtt-armory-m249/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>WTT - Armory - M249</strong></a> v1.0.3</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2086-wtt-patriot-1776/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>WTT - Patriot 1776</strong></a> v1.0.3</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2000-wtt-armory-svd/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>WTT - Armory - SVD</strong></a> v1.0.7</li>\n<li><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1928-wtt-armory-wilson-combat/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WTT - Armory - Wilson Combat</a></strong> v1.0.5</li>\n<li><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2374-wtt-armory-m76/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WTT - Armory - Zastava M76</a></strong> <strong>v1.0.1</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/39392-epicrangetime/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">EpicRangeTime</a>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1764-epic-s-all-in-one/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">All in One</a> v2.1.2</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2335-wtt-m700-long-action/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WTT - M700 Long Action</a> v1.0.1</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2175-wtt-taste-the-rainbow/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WTT - Taste the Rainbow</a> v1.0.0</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/user-file-list/51812-sianyde/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Sianyde</strong></a>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1901-wtt-cz-scorpion-evo-3/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>CZ Scorpion Evo</strong></a> v1.1.3</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1957-wtt-heckler-koch-g3\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>H&amp;K G3</strong></a> v1.1.5</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1862-wtt-remington-adaptive-combat-rifle\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Remington ACR</strong></a> v1.1.3</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/57543-gamma/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Gamma</a>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2224-wtt-armory-xm8/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WTT - Armory - XM8</a> v1.0.0</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/41764-rexana/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Rexana</a>: (The below links do not work anymore, but most of the guns can be found in the <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://discord.com/channels/478334515488751617/1315025109517467720/1315025109517467720\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WTT discord channel</a>)</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2368-hoshizora/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">“Hoshizora“ Custom SCAR 17</a></strong> <strong>v1.0.0</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2231-rexana-s-new-desert-eagle/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Rexana’s Desert Eagle</a> v1.0.0</strong> </li>\n<li><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2104-rexana-s-waifu-glock/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Rexana’s Waifu Glock</a> v1.0.0</strong></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2274-wtt-armory-barrett-m107a1/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>WTT - Armory - Barrett M107A1</strong></a> <strong>v1.0.4</strong></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2150-wtt-armory-arx160/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>WTT - Armory - Beretta ARX160</strong></a> <strong>v1.0.0</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2074-wtt-armory-cheytac-intervention/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WTT - Armory - Cheytac Intervention</a> v1.0.4</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2203-wtt-armory-tar21/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WTT - Armory - IWI Tavor TAR21</a> v1.0.0</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2204-wtt-armory-x95/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WTT - Armory - IWI Tavor X95</a> v1.0.0</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2359-wtt-armory-remington-acr/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WTT - Armory - Remington ACR</a> v1.0.0</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2361-wtt-armory-remington-msr/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WTT - Armory - Remington MSR</a> v1.0.2</strong> </li>\n<li><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2311-wtt-armory-r5/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WTT - Armory - Remington R5</a> v1.0.1</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2042-wtt-armory-rextac-wages-of-sin/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WTT - Armory - REXTAC Wages of Sin</a> v1.0.1</strong> </li>\n<li><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2024-wtt-armory-rex-is-a-prodigy/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WTT - Armory - Springfield Prodigy</a> v1.0.4</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2119-wtt-armory-type-99-arisaka/#overview\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WTT - Armory - Type 99 Arisaka</a> v1.0.4</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Note</strong></p>\n<p>The patches for the Ak5c, CZ Scorpion, CZ75, EDC X9, H&amp;K G3, HK417, Remington ACR (Sianyde), SVD, WoS AR15, and most of ERT’s AIO are the already existing patches with my tweaks. I recommend using mine over the ones provided with the mods.</p>\n<p>If you experience any issues, feel free to open an issue. If fixing it yourself is more your thing, there’s a guide on how to contribute on the GitHub repository.</p>\n<p>I plan on adding compats for more WTT Armory weapons along the road, feel free to suggest any that don’t have compats</p>\n<p><strong>Dependencies</strong></p>\n<p>You’ll need the weapon mod(s) that you need compatibility for**,** and <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/606-spt-realism-mod/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>SPT Realism</strong></a> for this to do anything.</p>\n<p><strong>Notes</strong></p>\n<p>1. For Realism versions prior to v1.4.5, this will basically never malfunction. This is due to how malfunction calculations were changed in Realism v1.4.5.</p>\n<p>2. I’ve included patches for the AK5C, CZ Scorpion, CZ75, EDC X9, H&amp;K G3, HK417, Intervention, Prodigy, Remington ACR (Sianyde), SVD, WoS AR15, and most of ERT’s AIO. These are the already existing patches with my tweaks. I recommend using mine over the ones bundled with the mods.</p>\n<p><strong>Known Issues &amp; Their Solutions</strong></p>\n<p>1. <strong>Heavy weapons spin all over the place</strong>: It should’ve been fixed in one of the latest Realism updates, and I’ve not been able to reproduce from the limited information. So no known fix exists until people give us good bug reports so we can reproduce.</p>\n<p><strong>Installation</strong></p>\n<p>1. Download the latest release.</p>\n<p>2. Drop the provided user folder into your SPT folder.</p>\n<p>3. Make sure that the SPT Realism mod loads AFTER all your gun mods.</p>\n<p>This can be achieved using the order.json. Example:</p>\n<p>{ “order”: [ “1WTT-Armory-Remington ACR”, “WTT-Armory-Ak5C”, “WTT-Armory-XM8”, “WTT-M700 Long Action Lapua”, “WTT-M700 Long Action Norma”, “SPT-Realism” ] } or by using a tool like <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1082-loe-load-order-editor/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Load Order Editor</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>If the changes don’t load, you may want to also clear cache / temp files.</strong></p>\n<p>3. In \\user\\cache, delete:</p>\n<p>bundleHashCache.json, jsonCache.json, and modCache.json</p>\n<p>But do NOT delete the folder named bundles.</p>\n<p>4. In the SPT launcher, clear temp files:</p>\n<p>Open launcher &gt; Click settings &gt; Click clean temp files</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 185, "published_at": "2024-09-30T18:23:02.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1756/wtt-armory-realism-compatibility-patch/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 352, "publ